<title>UK: Sixt AG adds 50 mln Dem to five-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sixt AG adds 50 mln Dem to five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased by 50 million marks to 250 million marks, lead manager Bayerische Hypotheken-und Wechselbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIXT AG</p>
<p> AMT    *250 MLN DEM  COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    18.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.50    PAY DATE    18.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING    FRANKFURT DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    TAX PROVS  STANDARD  LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.75	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL 200 MLN DEM LAUNCED 18.NOV.96</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
